  "notes": "Ten goodsTypes share one BLE builder set; the family has a mic sub-mode only (0x13 music is declared but unused). Scene IDs and many DIY codes are cloud/base-config driven; only H7072=765, H2800=960/963, H3700=999/9998/10001 and H7075 protocol 0x56 are explicit. CheckIc/CutCali payload shapes are shared with the H705A codebase (0x43/0x44/0x46). H3351 gear is UI-only. Matter is commissioning-only. Motion timer/threshold payloads are runtime structures."
